 *  Healthcare Initiatives Board — Google Apps Script backend (Code.gs)
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------
 *  • Database   : the Google Spreadsheet below (one tab per entity)
 *  • API        : doPost() JSON API consumed by the GitHub Pages frontend
 *  • Auth       : Google Identity Services ID token → verified server-side
